WEBVTT

00:15:29.663 --> 00:15:32.206
and if we can get others seeing business differently,

00:15:32.206 --> 00:15:35.011
we can change the world.

00:15:35.011 --> 00:15:38.216
I know it. I'm seeing it.

00:15:38.216 --> 00:15:40.166
I'm feeling it.

00:15:40.166 --> 00:15:41.861
Young people, I think,

00:15:41.861 --> 00:15:45.041
my Harvard Business School students, are getting it.

00:15:45.041 --> 00:15:49.363
If we can break down this sort of divide,

00:15:49.363 --> 00:15:52.373
this unease, this tension,

00:15:52.373 --> 00:15:54.303
this sense that we're not

00:15:54.303 --> 00:15:56.543
fundamentally collaborating here

00:15:56.543 --> 00:15:58.893
in driving these social problems,

00:15:58.893 --> 00:16:00.997
we can break this down,